@host = http://localhost:5178

### Estado atual das dependencias simuladas
GET {{host}}/simulation

### Liveness - so pergunta se o processo responde
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Readiness - pergunta se a instancia pode receber trafego
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Visao completa, para humano e painel
GET {{host}}/health

### Derruba o banco: readiness vira 503, liveness continua 200
POST {{host}}/simulation/database?state=Down

### Banco lento alem do timeout de 2s: a checagem e cancelada
POST {{host}}/simulation/database?state=Hanging

### Cache fora do ar: dependencia nao critica, resultado Degraded e 200
POST {{host}}/simulation/cache?state=Down

### Cache lento (1s) acima do orcamento de 500ms: Degraded pela latencia
POST {{host}}/simulation/cache?state=Slow

### Broker fora do ar: dependencia critica, readiness vira 503
POST {{host}}/simulation/broker?state=Down

### Restaura tudo
POST {{host}}/simulation/database?state=Healthy

###
POST {{host}}/simulation/broker?state=Healthy

###
POST {{host}}/simulation/cache?state=Healthy
